  "evidence": "TEXT_C: Regain full lawmaking supremacy outside the ECJ/ECHR; exit the single market/customs union and regain an independent WTO seat; create a Fisheries Protection Force; +20,000 police and +7,000 prison officers with tougher prison controls; UK Bill of Rights and opt-out of the European Arrest Warrant; target balanced net migration via a points/work‑permit system, 4,000 extra border staff, UK‑first job advertising, five‑year contributions before most benefits/non‑urgent NHS, and a ban on face coverings with “one law for all”; defence at a genuine 2% of GDP plus +£1bn/year, +20,000 personnel, independent nuclear deterrent, and veterans’ housing/jobs guarantees; NHS +£9bn/year, social care +£2bn/year, mental health +£500m, dementia plan, and higher Carer’s Allowance; business rates cuts and crackdown on multinational profit‑shifting. TEXT_F: 10,000 more police, 500 more border guards, 3,000 more prison officers; defence ≥2% GDP and renew nuclear deterrent; end freedom of movement but seek Single Market/Customs Union benefits and guarantee EU nationals’ rights; maintain 0.7% aid; >£30bn extra for NHS, £8bn more for social care, ring‑fenced mental health; extensive worker protections (ban zero‑hours, £10 Living Wage, day‑one rights, sectoral bargaining); major social housing and rent caps; higher taxes for top earners and large corporations; strong environmental measures including Clean Air Act and fracking ban.",
